  "claims": [
    "A tokenomics trace with stepwise supply nonincrease has nonnegative supply drop.",
    "Supply contraction bounded by a factor q <= 1 remains bounded by the initial supply.",
    "Every admitted supply burn must be funded by treasury/resource drawdown, so total supply drop is bounded by initial treasury when terminal treasury is nonnegative.",
    "When output is nondecreasing and positive supply is preserved, output per token is monotone across admitted traces.",
    "Reward, rebate, bounty, and buyback spend over a trace is bounded by verified value gained plus treasury/resource drawdown.",
    "If no verified value is gained and no treasury/resource budget is consumed, a guarded controller cannot produce positive reward spend.",
    "If observed reward spend exceeds verified value plus budget, at least one stepwise funding premise is false."
  ],
